---
// Sveltia CMS shell, served at /admin/. The CMS bundle is imported from npm so
// Vite emits it as a hashed /_astro/ file and the site-wide CSP of
// script-src 'self' still holds; the extra origins the admin page needs are
// spliced in by nginx (see security-headers.conf and nginx.conf).
// Unlike the CDN build, the npm package never auto-initialises, so init() is
// called explicitly; with no arguments it loads the config from the
// cms-config-url link below. Keep this page free of any site layout, CSS or
// other markup: the CMS owns the whole document. See docs/cms-and-submissions.md.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>CHS Mesh CMS</title>
    <link href="/admin/config.yml" type="application/yaml" rel="cms-config-url" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <script>
      import { init } from '@sveltia/cms';

      init();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
